# Normalise line endings regardless of anyone's `core.autocrlf`.
#
# Not cosmetic: `oxfmt --check` is part of `pnpm check`, so a CRLF checkout on a Windows
# machine or CI runner would fail the gate for a reason that has nothing to do with the code.
* text=auto eol=lf

